{"id":"chatcmpl-92bb3590-4e90-4624-9c72-bb562645cb1c","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245268,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a multi-tool verification strategy for distinguishing between two mutually exclusive spatial findings (left vs. right). The key insight is to use independent tools to confirm laterality rather than relying on a single source, and to test the specific hypothesis (grounding the candidate phrase) rather than only asking open-ended questions. The final answer is validated by spatial grounding that maps the finding to the correct anatomical side.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When options differ only by laterality (left vs. right), use at least two independent tools to confirm the side before answering.\",\n    \"Convert the leading candidate option into a specific phrase and test whether it can be grounded/localized in the image, rather than only asking a general presence question.\",\n    \"Use an open-ended expert query first to establish presence and location, then use a targeted grounding query to verify the specific laterality claimed by the top option.\",\n    \"Cross-check the grounded localization against the image's anatomical orientation (e.g., patient's right appears on image left) to avoid left/right confusion.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Ask an expert tool for presence and location first, then independently ground the specific candidate finding to confirm laterality; always verify anatomical orientation conventions.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice with spatial distinctions\": \"Treat each option as a hypothesis; test the most likely one with a targeted localization query and confirm with a second independent method before committing.\",\n    \"Tool-orchestrated verification\": \"Combine a general descriptive tool with a specific grounding tool so that one establishes context and the other validates the precise claim.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the finding's laterality using at least two independent tools or queries before selecting an answer.\",\n    \"Verify that the grounded location matches the correct anatomical side given standard image orientation (patient right = image left).\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":505,"total_tokens":897,"completion_tokens":392,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":505},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":392}}}